  "scenes": [
    {
      "sceneId": "scene-01",
      "title": "COLD OPEN — THE AUDIENCE IS DOING NOTHING",
      "lines": [
        {
          "eventId": "event-0002",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "We have listeners!",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0003",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "What are they producing?",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0004",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "They're listening.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0005",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "And their computers?",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0006",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "Also listening. Less attentively.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0007",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "Listening is not doing nothing. An audience gives us something a computer cannot measure by counting its instructions.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0008",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "I was counting its electricity.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0009",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "Wait. Their machines are already working to receive the show. What if a little more of that work could help make the next one?",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0010",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "A listener is not a power socket.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0011",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "A voluntary power socket.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0012",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "With whose electricity?",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0015",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "We appear to have discovered consent before discovering the product.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0016",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "Good. We can put it near the beginning.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        }
      ],
      "characterCount": 576,
      "wordCount": 95
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "scene-02",
      "title": "ACT ONE — THE MACHINE THAT WATCHES ITSELF",
      "lines": [
        {
          "eventId": "event-0018",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "An ordinary browser. No new account. No purchase of cryptocurrency. Could it do a small job while the radio plays?",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0019",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "There is a protocol called x four oh two Work. A server asks for a proof of computation before granting access to a resource.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0020",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "A toll booth that accepts perspiration.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0021",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "Computational perspiration. Request a resource, receive a work offer, solve it, send the proof, and let the server verify it.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0022",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "Then the audience can keep helping for an entire episode!",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0023",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "That last sentence contains a new experiment. One proof pays for one request. Continuous participation needs its own controls.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0024",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "And a limit.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0025",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "A one-hour game. Smaller jobs inside it. A smaller clock inside each job.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0026",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "Clocks all the way down.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0027",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "First sub-game: can we accept bounded jobs while playback continues? Ten minutes is the proposed test window, not a result we have already measured.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0028",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "The prototype is on the desk.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0029",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "Put the receipt beside it.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        }
      ],
      "characterCount": 898,
      "wordCount": 155
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "scene-03",
      "title": "ACT TWO — THE TREADMILL",
      "lines": [
        {
          "eventId": "event-0031",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "First design: use all the computation!",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0032",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "Rejected before testing.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0033",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "You didn't even let the fan finish.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0034",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "A sound effect is not evidence of an overheated listener.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0035",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "Nor is somebody else's electricity a free production budget.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0036",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "Fine. Three choices. Listen normally. Contribute a little work. Or enter Focus Mode.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0037",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "Listening normally must start no computation. Contributions need a separate, explicit choice.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0038",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "Focus Mode may reduce distractions. It cannot certify what a person is thinking.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0039",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "What if we can prove the computer stayed on the page?",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0040",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "Then you know something about the computer's page. You have not measured attention.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0041",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "The audience has escaped your spreadsheet.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0042",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "One background worker. A three-second job limit. A hundred thousand guesses at most. Rest between jobs. Stop means stop.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0043",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "Pause the audio or hide the page, and work stops. A failed job stops the loop. It does not quietly start another attempt.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0044",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "The right to listen includes the right to contribute nothing.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        }
      ],
      "characterCount": 951,
      "wordCount": 155
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "scene-04",
      "title": "ACT THREE — THE ADDRESS ON THE TREADMILL",
      "lines": [
        {
          "eventId": "event-0046",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "So Future Radio is powered by its audience!",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0047",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "Show me the beneficiary.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0048",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "The what?",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0049",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "The address that receives any potential reward.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0050",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "The public Quai demonstration has its own configured recipient. That is not an established Future Radio payout address.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0052",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "So a successful demonstration could demonstrate the wrong business model.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0053",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "It can demonstrate real access payment. It cannot demonstrate that the show received money.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0054",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "Your treadmill is plugged into somebody else's ledger.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0055",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "Then we label it.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0056",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "Official demonstration work. Beneficiary disclosed before starting. Future Radio funding branch not configured.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0057",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "And the demonstration distinguishes live-source receipts from practice receipts. Practice must not become network work through enthusiastic typography.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0058",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "We can still make the page playable.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0059",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "Yes. We can demonstrate the mechanism while admitting that the financing experiment is unfinished.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0060",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "A demonstration in progress.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0061",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "An honest title for a door that is not yet open.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        }
      ],
      "characterCount": 949,
      "wordCount": 142
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "scene-05",
      "title": "ACT FOUR — DOES IT PAY?",
      "lines": [
        {
          "eventId": "event-0063",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "How much money did we make?",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0064",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "I was going to show you a large number of hashes.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0065",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "I have prepared an empty revenue column especially for that answer.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0066",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "Three records. Work accepted by a verifier. Actual rewards received. Cost of producing this episode.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0067",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "An access receipt proves that a proof was accepted for a request. It does not establish a block reward.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0068",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "What does our ledger say?",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0069",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "It reports accepted receipts by source. It does not turn practice into live work, or a moving meter into an invoice paid.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0070",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "And the show's reward records?",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0071",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "No configured show payout address. No reconciled network-reward claim. Those are unfinished measurements, not a secret profit.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0072",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "What about our costs?",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0073",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "Voice synthesis credits. The production recipe. Compute time where recorded. Unknown dollar charges, human effort and energy stay visible.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0074",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "A blank field is more useful than an invented zero.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0075",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "And zero accepted receipts is a valid result if the real system has accepted none.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0076",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "The ledger can disappoint us?",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0077",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "That is its most important feature.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        }
      ],
      "characterCount": 1004,
      "wordCount": 170
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "scene-06",
      "title": "ACT FIVE — THE AUDIENCE JOINS THE GAME",
      "lines": [
        {
          "eventId": "event-0079",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "The page has an episode, a voluntary work control, and a results ledger.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0080",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "No work starts merely because the page opened or the audio began. Read the beneficiary and bounds before choosing to start.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0081",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "If a receipt arrives, the Orchestra can play a quiet tick. An accepted contribution becomes audible without turning a listener into a public profile.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0082",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "And when no receipt arrives?",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0083",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "The Orchestra rests.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0084",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "A surprisingly economical instrument.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0085",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "Second sub-game: compare playback with computation off and on. Record stalls and the length of the actual test. Do not claim an uninterrupted hour from a short rehearsal.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0086",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "And the third?",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0087",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "Reconcile one validated record against production costs and genuine rewards. Fifteen minutes is the proposed window. It may end with missing evidence.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0088",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "Preserve the experiment so the next producer can change a step without rediscovering the whole machine.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0089",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "Could audience work offset the cost of one minute of Future Radio?",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0090",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "That is our next question. It is not today's answer.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        }
      ],
      "characterCount": 984,
      "wordCount": 161
    },
    {
      "sceneId": "scene-07",
      "title": "ENDING — THE TREADMILL GOES NOWHERE",
      "lines": [
        {
          "eventId": "event-0092",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "We're moving.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0093",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "We're sitting still.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0094",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "That's what treadmills do.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0095",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "Then where are we going?",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0096",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "We'll know when we see what the work produces.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0097",
          "characterId": "eval",
          "text": "Until then: contribution is not attention. A receipt is not revenue. And someone else must still choose whether to participate.",
          "voiceId": "2WmCrP0cJGnh2QX210KX"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0098",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "Can the audience help support the next episode?",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0099",
          "characterId": "agnolo",
          "text": "Give me a real result, a real cost, and the correct address. Then we can ask how far the belt has taken us.",
          "voiceId": "s2wvuS7SwITYg8dqsJdn"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0100",
          "characterId": "borges",
          "text": "The experiment remains open.",
          "voiceId": "TLugb594bskyzPlFSOkh"
        },
        {
          "eventId": "event-0101",
          "characterId": "leonardo",
          "text": "And the listening remains free of the experiment.",
          "voiceId": "s5t7B6IvxVOp3Y7HQT6Q"
        }
      ],
